  unitName: Great Thief Leon
  unitId: 10063
  unitNumber: 312
  description: A great thief who once claimed the ruined Agni Empire as his territory.
    Leon and his twin blades often found themselves pitted against the authority
    of gods and public officials. However, during this time he was held up as someone
    who fought against anyone that tormented humans. He paid little mind to this
    words, and further continued stealing as if to make sure it was known that he
    was still in fact a thief.
  summonDesc: I'll always be a thief!<br>If you understand what I mean,<br>I'll lend
    you my power!
  fusionDesc: Not a bad reward.<br>I'll help you out in return<br>for your trouble.
  evoDesc: Once a thief, always a thief.<br>I've no interest in becoming<br>a hero
    or anything like that!
  element: 1
  rarity: 3
